cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Formal Verification of Parity Obstructions and Fixed-Point Exclusions for Proper-Divisor Moments (OEIS A245211) in Lean 4"
message: "If you use this Lean 4 formalization or verification script for OEIS A245211, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
